                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "7228223e-eced-4e72-a1ed-f66a0815d1d0",
                        "entry_id": "d1597c18-bdd9-37fb-a8f7-a8e3e7426947",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "paraphilies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "99cee8b9-ad9c-3dc9-8cf5-20afc001260c",
                        "entry_id": "d1597c18-bdd9-37fb-a8f7-a8e3e7426947",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Comportement sexuel considéré comme déviant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f5c5cab-1e9e-4077-bedd-b39774cfe1d9",
                                "sense_id": "99cee8b9-ad9c-3dc9-8cf5-20afc001260c",
                                "text": "Pendant le procès des viols de Mazan, le principal accusé, Dominique Pelicot, a été présenté par les experts psychiatres comme un homme atteint de plusieurs perversions sexuelles – on préfère aujourd’hui parler de « paraphilie »."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5cf876a2-2198-3ca9-87d6-0b18bda4218a",
                        "entry_id": "d1597c18-bdd9-37fb-a8f7-a8e3e7426947",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Toute attraction ou pratique sexuelle qui diffère des actes sexuels considérés comme faisant partie d’une sexualité normale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "200adc86-6ceb-481e-87b4-835cca197d57",
                                "sense_id": "5cf876a2-2198-3ca9-87d6-0b18bda4218a",
                                "text": "Une paraphilie, « c’est en quelque sorte aimer quelque chose ou une activité en marge de ce qu’aime la grande majorité des personnes », écrit Serge Stoléru, psychiatre et chercheur à l’Inserm-Hôpital Paul-Brousse, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1eff6274-986d-4de2-bee7-c05d18eceb95",
                        "source_entry_id": "d1597c18-bdd9-37fb-a8f7-a8e3e7426947",
                        "source_sense_description": "Comportement sexuel considéré comme déviant",
                        "target_lang_word": "Paraphilia",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4c5ea0f5-043f-4a84-9e18-d749826b3511",
                        "source_entry_id": "d1597c18-bdd9-37fb-a8f7-a8e3e7426947",
                        "source_sense_description": "Comportement sexuel considéré comme déviant",
                        "target_lang_word": "paraphilia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paraphilia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                        "entry_id": "fd379dc1-06d5-31e7-bdcd-21162f3976ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An abnormal sexual arousal or attraction, especially to objects or situations that are not of a sexual nature; typically of extreme or pathological nature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ffd9953-5b97-49fc-ac73-ba52812ac89e",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "Despite the serial aspect of these killings, lust murder still remains a distinct subcategory of both sexual and serial murder. It is also referred to as erotophonophilia, one of the most extreme forms of paraphilia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "135d91e9-9f45-4fea-b142-50707b7ce573",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "Formal study will be necessary to clarify the nature, prevalence, and interrelations of plushophilia, fursuitism, and autoplushophilia among furverts and to document the nature and extent of any co-occurring paraphilias."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c68b49b-aa14-4af1-ae02-f591b2e24d76",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "Yes, really. Blanchard has expanded the DSM's \"paraphilia\" section (where crimes such as paedophilia and exhibitionism go) to include transvestic disorder."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18c6c4c8-653a-477b-8909-7fc856af5bac",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "As Stoller says, \"perversion is a sturdy word, throbbing with assumptions, while paraphilia is a wet noodle.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdb1a576-6aac-4760-8bd0-f5f9e4d86de9",
                                                "sense_id": "d825a514-b645-3cc8-99d1-f2963aa9e7d4",
                                                "text": "Other paraphilias are more blatantly transgressive and usually illegal: amokoscisia (desire to slash or mutilate females); anthropophagy (cannibalism); anthropophagolagnia (rape accompanied by cannibalism); […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d701d914-3e2e-37e3-a84b-b5727aa4f87f",
                                        "entry_id": "fd379dc1-06d5-31e7-bdcd-21162f3976ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexual arousal in response to sexual objects or situations which may interfere with the capacity for reciprocal affectionate sexual activity or lead to clinically significant distress or impairment (e.g. are obligatory, require participation of unconsenting individuals, lead to legal issues)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "47812b9c-9a78-44cd-82d9-e52f8df09162",
                        "source_entry_id": "d1597c18-bdd9-37fb-a8f7-a8e3e7426947",
                        "source_sense_description": "Comportement sexuel considéré comme déviant",
                        "target_lang_word": "parafilia",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "parafilia",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3cc0637-7fd5-3e62-956d-9a7c88a0a67c",
                                        "entry_id": "1ad2876d-66ec-3400-b060-678742bb55d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Atracción sexual por personas, comportamientos u objetos que no forman parte del estándar culturalmente asociado al sexo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78e67d80-16f0-460a-bec5-175ee8e27cf2",
                                                "sense_id": "e3cc0637-7fd5-3e62-956d-9a7c88a0a67c",
                                                "text": "«Podemos repasar algunas parafilias para comprender la dimensión colosal de este paisaje. Los emetofílicos sienten placer sexual en el vómito. Los vampiristas, en el contacto con la sangre. La lascivia de los agorafílicos –que no son necesariamente exhibicionistas– se desata con la actividad sexual en lugares públicos»."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8ded140-5e13-43f0-884c-85d616015954",
                                                "sense_id": "e3cc0637-7fd5-3e62-956d-9a7c88a0a67c",
                                                "text": "«“Es bien importante entender que toda sexualidad, incluyendo la masturbación, son elementos privados. Nada de hacerlo en la calle, y es un delito porque la ley lo establece como exposición deshonesta. Es una parafilia”, insistió el educador»."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc7f80cf-bead-4b14-9c86-0300b4948b46",
                                                "sense_id": "e3cc0637-7fd5-3e62-956d-9a7c88a0a67c",
                                                "text": "«También existe una técnica llamada hipoxifilia (asfixia erótica); es una parafilia que algunos adolescentes (y personas, en general) utilizan para aumentar la satisfacción sexual, impidiendo la respiración de la pareja o de uno mismo»."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f085da23-b4ba-4862-a18d-1de3d99bbd68",
